narrative:
Admission to the major is contingent upon fulfilling the following requirements:
- At least a 2.7 University of California grade-point average in Area I;
- At least a 2.0 University of California grade-point average in Area II;
- All courses must be completed on a letter-grade basis;
- No courses with a grade lower than C- in Area I & II;
- Not more than one course with a C- in Area I & II;
- Students must submit a “Petition to Change Major” to the departmental main office (1814 Psychology East) for admission to the pre-major and major.
